---
title: Man o' war
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, whiskey]
source: Man O' War by Difford's Guide, https://www.diffordsguide.com/cocktails/recipe/4819/man-o-war
---

Shake the @bourbon{45%ml}, @triple sec{15%ml}, @sweet vermouth{15%ml} and @lemon juice{15%ml} hard with ice in a #cocktail shaker{}.

Fine-strain into a chilled #coupe glass{}.

Twist a strip of @lemon zest{} over the drink, then add a @cocktail cherry{}.
